        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.325,
            0.834,
            0.393
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Recall that when some whole number of things are shared equally among some number of people, fractions tell us how much each share is."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.167,
            0.398,
            0.798,
            0.478
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Shabnam: Do you remember, if one roti is divided equally between two children, how much roti will each child get?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.482,
            0.606,
            0.504
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Mukta: Each child will get half a roti."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.509,
            0.667,
            0.589
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Shabnam: The fraction ‘one half’ is written as "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " . We also sometimes read this as ‘one upon two.’"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.702,
            0.42,
            0.809,
            0.576
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 9,
              "bbox": [
                0.702,
                0.42,
                0.809,
                0.576
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_0_image_9.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.593,
            0.769,
            0.643
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Mukta: If one roti is equally shared among 4 children, how much roti will one child get?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.648,
            0.575,
            0.673
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Shabnam: Each child’s share is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 4 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " roti."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.675,
            0.666,
            0.703
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Mukta: And which is more "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " roti or "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 4 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " roti?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.704,
            0.668,
            0.839
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Shabnam: When 2 children share 1 roti equally, each child gets "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " roti. When 4 children share 1 roti equally, each child gets "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 4 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " roti. Since, in the second group more children share the"
            }
          ]
        },
